sequenceDiagram

    participant A as Worker Session A
    participant C as Worker Session C
    participant Controller
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over A,DB: workerId = build-host-worker
    Note over DB: authoritative session = A

    A->>Controller: disconnect / become unavailable

    C->>Controller: Register workerId, session C
    Controller->>DB: Read authority → A

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
        Note over Controller,DB: Atomic takeover transaction
        Controller->>DB: Schedule recovery for A
        Controller->>DB: Mark A permanently retired
        Controller->>DB: CAS authority A → C
    end

    DB-->>Controller: COMMIT
    Controller-->>C: Registration accepted

    A->>Controller: Late reconnect
    Controller->>DB: Is A retired?
    DB-->>Controller: yes
    Controller-->>A: Reject stale session
